1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
先看第一張快照。左邊的峰比右邊高。
In the first snapshot, the left peak is taller.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:14,000
再看第二張。現在，較高的峰在哪一邊？
Now look at the second. Which side has the taller peak?

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:19,000
對準同樣的兩個位置。左邊變矮了，右邊變高了。
Compare the same two positions. The left peak shrank and the right one grew.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:30,000
曲線的高度是密度。掃過曲線下方，就能把質量累加起來。
Height gives density. Sweeping out the area adds up the mass.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
兩張快照的總質量都是 1。
Both snapshots have a total mass of one.

6
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:45,000
只憑這兩張圖，你會說熱點移動了嗎？
With just these two snapshots, would you say the hotspot moved?

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:58,000
這個空間是一個圓環。把它攤開，看看接縫去了哪裡。
Unroll the circle and keep your eye on the seam.

8
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:07,000
直線的 0 和 1 是同一個位置。現在把其中一格放大。
Zero and one mark the same place. Now zoom in on one cell.

9
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:20,000
左邊流入的質量比右邊流出的多，格內存量就會上升。
More mass enters on the left than leaves on the right, so the cell fills.

10
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:34,000
格內也可以在原位產生質量。橙色箭頭標出這個來源。
Mass can also appear inside the cell. The orange arrow marks this source.

11
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:42,000
把這個收支關係寫在每個位置，就得到連續方程。
Write this mass balance at each position to obtain the continuity equation.

12
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:55,000
通量取決於速度。局部源項取決於原位增減的速率。
Flux depends on velocity. The local source depends on the growth or decay rate.

13
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:01,000
先試一個只靠搬運的解釋。把起始密度拆成兩個峰。
Try a history driven by transport alone. Split the starting profile into two peaks.

14
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:09,000
在每個位置加起兩個峰的高度，白線就是總密度。
Add their heights at each position. The white curve is the total density.

15
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:27,000
較大的峰從 0.28 向右，較小的峰從 0.58 向左。
The larger peak moves right from 0.28. The smaller moves left from 0.58.

16
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:35,000
時間過半，兩個中心在 0.43 相遇。兩份密度疊成一個高峰。
Halfway through, the centres meet at 0.43 and their densities form one tall peak.

17
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:54,000
兩個中心穿過彼此，沿原來的方向繼續前進。
The centres pass each other and continue in their original directions.

18
00:02:54,000 --> 00:03:05,000
峰交換了位置。從頭到尾，圈內的質量都等於 1。
The peaks have exchanged places. Total mass stayed at one throughout.

19
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:17,000
回到同一起點。這次，把兩支探針固定在原位。
Return to the same start. This time, keep both probes still.

20
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:25,000
每個位置都有起始密度 a 和終點密度 b。
At each position, call the starting density a and the final density b.

21
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:35,000
對數密度沿直線變化。兩支探針的讀數一降一升。
Log density changes along straight lines. One probe falls while the other rises.

22
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:46,000
回到原來的密度刻度，每個位置都按自己的固定相對速率增減。
On the density scale, each position grows or decays at its own constant relative rate.

23
00:03:46,000 --> 00:04:09,000
看下方的總質量。雖然首尾都是 1，這條歷程的中途總量較小。
Watch total mass below. It dips between the two unit-mass endpoints.

24
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:20,000
速度處處為零，終點仍然和搬運歷程逐格吻合。
Velocity is zero everywhere, yet every final cell matches the transport history.

25
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:31,000
把每一刻的密度畫成一行顏色。兩幅圖共用同一個色標。
Encode each density profile as a row of colour. Both panels use the same scale.

26
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:40,000
一行一行疊上去。向上是時間，向右是位置。
Stack the rows. Time runs upward and position runs to the right.

27
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:53,000
左圖的亮帶斜著交會。右圖的亮度在兩個固定位置改變。
Bright ridges cross on the left. On the right, brightness changes at two fixed sites.

28
00:04:53,000 --> 00:05:12,000
沿時間軸回看中段。同一時刻，兩條歷程給出的密度形狀不同。
Revisit the middle. At the same time, the two histories give different profiles.

29
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:19,000
如果相機只拍到首尾，會留下多少分辨兩者的線索？
If the camera records only the start and finish, what evidence survives?

30
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:30,000
比較留下來的曲線。起點對起點、終點對終點，全部重合。
Compare the surviving curves. Both starts coincide, and so do both finishes.

31
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:40,000
非平衡最優傳輸容許邊際質量偏離輸入。先看一個起點格的配對。
Unbalanced optimal transport relaxes the marginal constraints. Follow one source cell.

32
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:53,000
起點格一換，配對也跟著換。每條線代表該橫列的十二分之一質量。
Change the source cell and its matches change. Each line represents one twelfth of its row mass.

33
00:05:53,000 --> 00:06:07,000
展開整個矩陣。每一橫列都對應一個起點格。
Open the full matrix. Each row corresponds to one source cell.

34
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:20,000
橫列和直欄的總和給出配對後的邊際質量。和灰色輸入比較一下。
Row and column sums give the paired marginals. Compare them with the grey inputs.

35
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:30,000
T 按圓環最短距離的平方計價。G 用 KL 散度計算兩端的邊際偏差。
T charges squared distance around the circle. G uses KL divergence for both marginal errors.

36
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:38,000
熵正則項 E 也會改變配對。三項相加，才是求解器要最小化的成本。
The entropy term E also shapes the coupling. The solver minimizes the sum of all three costs.

37
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:53,000
現在只取 T 和 G，看看搬運佔這兩項成本多少。
Now take T and G and ask what fraction of these two costs comes from transport.

38
00:06:53,000 --> 00:07:10,000
在這組價格下，搬運佔 50.03%。E 仍然影響所選的配對。
At these prices, transport takes 50.03% of the two costs. E still shapes the fitted coupling.

39
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:22,000
歷程的搬運佔比是 K/(K+λ²R)。K 量度搬運作用量，R 量度原位增減作用量。
The history's transport share is K/(K+λ²R). K and R measure transport and local-change action.

40
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:35,000
兩段歷程的真值是 0 和 1。相同端點只給一個估計 f，它離兩端有多遠？
The true shares are zero and one. Identical endpoints give one estimate f. How far is it from each?

41
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:50,000
試著移動估計值，令較長的一段盡量短。你會停在哪裡？
Move the estimate to shorten the longer segment. Where would you stop?

42
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:57,000
兩段距離的總和永遠是 1。
The two distances always add up to one.

43
00:07:57,000 --> 00:08:03,000
所以較長的一段至少有一半。這條下限適用於同時容許兩段歷程的端點問題。
The longer distance is at least one half whenever both histories are admissible.

44
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:20,000
15 組端點各配 24 個成本設定。每一點代表一個設定。
Each of 15 endpoint cases has 24 cost settings. One dot represents one setting.

45
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:27,000
按最壞差距排列，360 個設定之中最小的是 0.500273。
Order the 360 settings by worst discrepancy. The smallest value is 0.500273.

46
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:45,000
把刻度放大。最接近界線的結果，仍然在理論下限上方。
Magnify the scale. Even the closest result sits just above the theoretical bound.

47
00:08:45,000 --> 00:09:01,000
如果只可以再看一眼，你會選哪個位置、哪個時刻？
If you could take one more reading, where and when would you look?

48
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:09,000
回到兩個移動峰相遇的一刻，把時鐘停在一半。
Return to the instant when the moving peaks would meet. Stop halfway.

49
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:21,000
在位置 110/256 放一支理想探針。讓兩條歷程預測同一個讀數。
Place an ideal probe at position 110/256. Ask both histories to predict its reading.

50
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:35,000
逐步揭開周圍。搬運把密度集中在中間，原位增減保留了兩個峰。
Reveal the surroundings. Transport piles density in the middle. Local change retains two peaks.

51
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:44,000
同一位置、同一時刻，搬運預測 8.773，原位增減預測 0.051。
One place, one time. Transport predicts 8.773. Local change predicts 0.051.

52
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:51,000
這一個理想讀數已能分開這對合成歷程。
One ideal reading separates this pair of synthetic histories.

53
00:09:51,000 --> 00:10:00,000
實際觀測能否分辨，還要看感測器的空間解像度和噪聲。
For a real observation, the distinction depends on the sensor’s spatial resolution and noise.
